  m_Name: MallowQuest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - "You\u2019ve got soft steps for someone with business in these woods."
  - "\r*cough* *cough*"
  - "Tell me\u2026 you wouldn\u2019t be carrying any Glitterroom, would you?"
  - "Magic\u2019s been drifting odd lately. Folks avoid this grove, and the silence
    sits heavy."
  - "And I\u2014\r              well, these lungs of mine feel like they\u2019ve
    braided themselves with moss.\r\n"
  - "If you\u2019ve got even a pinch of the stuff\u2026 it might keep me upright
    a little longer."
  acceptOption: I can look for Glitterroom.
  acceptAnswer: "Ah\u2026 thank you. Glitterroom isn\u2019t fond of company. \nIt
    hides where the light forgets to look."
  declineOption: "I can\u2019t help you right now..."
  declineAnswer: "No harm in asking. I\u2019ll manage\u2026 \nor wheeze my way into
    the next sunrise.\r"
  comebackAfterDecline: "Back again? My offer still stands.\nGlitterroom\u2019s out
    there, and my lungs \nare running out of negotiations."
  comebackInProgress: "You\u2019re empty-handed. \nThat\u2019s all right. This Glitterroom
    is a bit special."
  comebackCompleted: "Is that\u2026? Yes. Glitterroom! \nFresh and stubborn. You\u2019ve
    done me a kindness \nI can\u2019t repay with coin or breath alone.\r"
  finalWords: "Thank you... Take this Stripped Scarf, \nit\u2019s traveled farther
    than I have strength left for. \nMay it keep the cold from biting too deep.\r\n"
